<title>USA: Symbol Tech sets split, initial cash payout.</title>
<headline>Symbol Tech sets split, initial cash payout.</headline>
<dateline>HOLTSVILLE, N.Y. 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Symbol Technologies Inc said Tuesday directors approved a three-for-two stock split to be effected as a 50 percent stock dividend and an initial $0.03 semiannual cash dividend.</p>
<p>Both the stock and initial cash dividends are payable April 1 to shareholders of record March 10.</p>
<p>&quot;Our continued financial success has allowed us to offer our shareholders the benefit of a regular semiannual dividend,&quot; said chief executive Jerome Swartz.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.))</p>
</text>
